# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# The design preview pages used to be ignored here, so they were
# never deployed. That also meant they were never BACKED UP: the
# whole Portfolio prototype existed only inside one temporary
# container. Not deployed and not saved are different problems,
# and one rule was treating them as one. Ruled by the owner on
# 23 August 2026: commit them. The login gate in middleware.ts
# still keeps every /preview page away from logged-out visitors.
